      "comment": "PARTY BOSS (2) progressive gelding returning from a lengthy break. Strengthened over the break and can pull out a big run fresh with the solid trial placing over 1000m. ROYAL RHINO (4) stepped up in trip from the wide gate with a courageous Maiden victory over 1200m at Corowa. Hard fit now and looks up to this stiffer test. MELODEE ROSE (3) resumes after showing ability when last in work. Comes to hand quickly and gets in light with Hill's 2kg claim. Fitted with the one 900m trial and will be doing her best work late. CASHBOOK (1) has struggled in two runs back and gets one more chance on the firmer track. Can stalk the fast tempo and take a hand in the finish.",
